{"title": "Illithid Persuasion", "pageid": 16096, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Illithid_Persuasion", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Illithid_Persuasion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Illithid_Persuasion.webp/300px-Illithid_Persuasion.webp, /w/images/c/c3/Illithid_Persuasion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Illithid_Persuasion.webp/300px-Illithid_Persuasion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Illithid_Persuasion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Illithid Persuasion</b> is a unique <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> which allows <a href=\"/wiki/Origin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Origin\">Origin</a> characters, as well as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a>, to impose their will onto others with the <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">Brand of the Absolute</a> through conversation. This ability is unlocked automatically.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Impose your authority onto those with the <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">Brand of the Absolute</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<p>During certain conversations just before dialog choices come up, the Narrator states <i>\"As the symbol glows, power courses through you. 'Authority'.\"</i> This means that a target character has the Brand of the Absolute and can be dominated mentally to submit to the interacting party member. \n</p><p>A <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;2 Wisdom Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;2 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> is usually required, though some interaction may require a higher <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">DC</a>. Despite the low check, having a 1 or having a negative can still result in a failure. The first through seventh times this power is used, a unique comment is made by the Narrator on each specific occasion. Once a character successfully exercises the persuasion power seven times, the dialogue option prompt for this power is changed to <a href=\"/wiki/True_Soul\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"True Soul\">True Soul</a> and most uses of it no longer require a check (though some options using the persuasion power may still require one). After this ability is used, the character cannot use it again until their next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Available to characters who have been <a href=\"/wiki/Tadpole\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tadpole\">tadpoled</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Early_Access\" title=\"Early Access\">Early Access</a>, the progression of the illithid powers worked differently. Instead, the player character's tadpole grew in power by using Illithid Persuasion options in dialogue. Once the player character had used Illithid Persuasion three times, they received a power unique to their <a href=\"/wiki/Classes\" title=\"Classes\">Class</a>. Some of these abilities were reworked into the current Illithid Powers.</li>\n<li>Normally, this power is automatically granted to all tadpoled companions. However, if a companion is convinced to use tadpole powers, and is <i>not</i> in the active party while being convinced, a bug prevents the ability from being granted. However, not having this ability does not affect a tadpoled character's ability to use Illtihid Persuasion in dialogue.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text_lines_after_using_Ilithid_Persuasion\">Text lines after using Ilithid Persuasion</span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>1st use</b>: <i>\"A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.\"</i> (This line is normally used only after saving <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Prologue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prologue\">Prologue</a>).</li>\n<li><b>2nd use</b>: <i>\"Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... It's taking something you'll never get back.\"</i></li>\n<li><b>3rd use</b>: <i>\"Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.\"</i></li>\n<li><b>4th use</b>: <i>\"A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be calm. You are loved.\"</i></li>\n<li><b>5th use</b>: <i>\"Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your mind.\"</i></li>\n<li><b>6th use</b>: <i>\"The presence deep in your mind is awake, unblinking. This is it. A single word pervades your consciousness: 'Soon'.\"</i></li>\n<li><b>7th use</b>: <i>\"Your mind is full, bursting with ecstasy and terror. Finally, it is coming. You are becoming.\"</i></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions_in_the_Prologue\">Interactions in the Prologue</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Saving <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> by using the <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Rune\" title=\"Eldritch Rune\">Eldritch Rune</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions_in_Act_One\">Interactions in Act One</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a> trying to bite during a long rest</li>\n<li>Talking with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Edowin\" title=\"Edowin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Portrait_Edowin.png/25px-Portrait_Edowin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Portrait_Edowin.png/38px-Portrait_Edowin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ad/Portrait_Edowin.png/50px-Portrait_Edowin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Edowin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Portrait_Edowin.png/25px-Portrait_Edowin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Portrait_Edowin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Edowin\" title=\"Edowin\">Edowin</a> automatically uses this ability on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brynna\" title=\"Brynna\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Brynna.png/25px-Portrait_Brynna.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Brynna.png/38px-Portrait_Brynna.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Brynna.png/50px-Portrait_Brynna.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brynna\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Portrait_Brynna.png/25px-Portrait_Brynna.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Portrait_Brynna.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brynna\" title=\"Brynna\">Brynna</a>; using it here can prevent a fight from breaking out</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Andrick\" title=\"Andrick\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_Andrick.png/25px-Portrait_Andrick.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_Andrick.png/38px-Portrait_Andrick.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_Andrick.png/50px-Portrait_Andrick.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Andrick\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_Andrick.png/25px-Portrait_Andrick.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Portrait_Andrick.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Andrick\" title=\"Andrick\">Andrick</a> in the owlbear cave</li>\n<li>Entering the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> through the eastern or southern gate; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Just_Passing_Through\" title=\"Charlatan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Just Passing Through\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Just_Passing_Through\" title=\"Charlatan\">Just Passing Through</a> is not granted when used</li>\n<li>Meeting with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/25px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/38px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/50px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fezzerk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png/25px-Portrait_Fezzerk.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Portrait_Fezzerk.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\">Fezzerk</a> at the windmill</li>\n<li>Entering the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> from the front or side entrance; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Very_Important_Parasite\" title=\"Charlatan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Very Important Parasite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Charlatan#Very_Important_Parasite\" title=\"Charlatan\">Very Important Parasite</a> is not granted when used</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> trying to kill the player character during a long rest; this happens after the <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Artefact\" title=\"Mysterious Artefact\">Mysterious Artefact</a> cutscene when reaching certain areas like Goblin camp</li>\n<li>Speaking with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Krolla\" title=\"Krolla\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Krolla.png/25px-Portrait_Krolla.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Krolla.png/38px-Portrait_Krolla.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Krolla.png/50px-Portrait_Krolla.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Krolla\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_Krolla.png/25px-Portrait_Krolla.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_Krolla.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Krolla\" title=\"Krolla\">Krolla</a> after asking about winnings</li>\n<li>Convincing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/38px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/50px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Klagga\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png/25px-Portrait_Klagga.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Portrait_Klagga.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Klagga\" title=\"Klagga\">Klagga</a> to give the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf%27s_Poem\" title=\"Dwarf's Poem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Book_Note_T_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dwarf%27s_Poem\" title=\"Dwarf's Poem\">Dwarf's Poem</a> to the party</li>\n<li>Speaking with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crusher\" title=\"Crusher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Portrait_Crusher.png/25px-Portrait_Cru